            <div class="intro-card">
              <p class="intro-eyebrow">Family-owned on the Suncoast since 2004</p>
              <h2 id="family-owned">Bradenton &amp; Sarasota Bathroom Remodeling</h2>
              <p class="intro-lead">A bathroom built around how you actually live — designed, permitted and built by one in-house crew.</p>
              <p>Your bathroom is the first room you use every morning and the last one at night, so it should work as well as it looks. We design and build bathrooms across Bradenton, Sarasota and the rest of the Suncoast, and we handle the whole thing ourselves: demolition, subfloor repair, plumbing and electrical rough-in, waterproofing, tile, vanity, glass and the last bead of caulk. One company, one schedule, one crew that stands behind the result.</p>
              <p>Most bathroom remodels go wrong in the handoffs. The demo crew leaves, the tile setter arrives and finds a rotted subfloor, and the schedule slips two weeks while everyone waits on somebody else's calendar. We do not have those handoffs, because there is nobody to hand off to — the people who quote your bathroom are the people in your house.</p>
              <p>Twenty-two years and more than 1,300 projects in, we have opened up enough Florida bathrooms to know what is usually behind the tile before we start. When we find something we did not expect, you get a photo of it and a price for the difference before we carry on.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-tiles">
              <div class="stat-tile"><b>2004</b><span>Family-owned since</span></div>
